[@5]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
Blast!  They have me!  Help me quick!

[@7]
<h2>~lYou</h2>
<p>
We will be right there!

[@10]
<h2>~rMaster of Wind</h2>
<p>
I cannot allow you to do that...

[@15]
<h2>~wRain Wizard</h2>
<p>
Like you can stop us!  We shall take you down and kill your master!

[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Cornered</h2> 
<i>"Money is everything, and when there is no money there is no production."<br>
--Harry Seymour, local Nimbian</i>
<p>While you were strolling along through the skies, you and Wind Knight were separated by two enemy islands.  Better act fast before this turns out to be a problem.
$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[Succeed]
[BadTeamDead]

<h2>Congratulations! Victory!</h2> 
<p>
You have rescued Wind Knight for the trap.  You are very close to your revenge now, but you still wounder how Lord Gunton got this many followers...
<$Config,Done{mission.filename}=1> 
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,0
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,b12

[ai2TempleDead]
<h2>~rMaster of Wind</h2>
<p>
Damn, I guess I underestimated you.

[ai3TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~wRain Wizard</h2>
<p>
Im under attack!

[ai3PriestDead]
<h2>Outcome</h2>
<p>
With the death of Rain Wizard, you were overwhelmed.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[ai4TempleHalfDead]
<h2>~gWind Knight</h2>
<p>
I need help here!

[ai4PriestDead]
<h2>Outcome</h2>
<p>
With the death of Wind Knight, you were overwhelmed.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[Failed]
<h2>Failure!</h2> 
<p> 
You have died in battle and what happened to your allies is irrelevant.
$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]
